---
/* Why the founder is building SoloFactory AI, in the founder's own words (2026-11-20).
   Only facts the founder gave go here. The blockers list is still to come from the founder:
   until then it shows a marked placeholder, and this section must not be published. */
---

<section class="section founder" id="founder" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
  <div class="container founder__inner">
    <figure class="founder__photo" data-reveal>
      <img
        src="/founder/rajesh-dayalan.webp"
        alt="Rajesh Dayalan, founder of SoloFactory AI"
        width="1024"
        height="1536"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="founder__copy" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Why I'm building SoloFactory AI</p>
      <h2 class="h2 founder__title" id="founder-title">
        I've lived the problem <span class="soft">we're solving.</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="founder__letter">
        <p>
          For four years, I bootstrapped a startup. But I wasn't able to make it a sustainable
          business.
        </p>
        <p>Looking back, I can see what blocked me:</p>
        <p class="founder__todo">[To add: the two or three things that blocked you, in your words.]</p>
        <p>
          I want to solve these problems for the new generation of entrepreneurs. That is why I am
          building SoloFactory AI.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="founder__sign">
        <span class="founder__name">Rajesh Dayalan</span>
        <span class="founder__role">Founder, SoloFactory AI</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 96px);
  }

  .founder__photo {
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  }

  .founder__photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 15%;
  }

  .founder__title {
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .founder__letter {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 58ch;
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .founder__todo {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--danger);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--danger-bg);
    color: var(--danger);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .founder__sign {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .founder__name {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .founder__role {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .founder__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .founder__photo {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 300px;
    }
  }
</style>
